      \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{topology.png} \caption{Actual topology of the public university. For the study, the sections “02 DATA CENTER” and “03 UNIVERSITY CAMPUS” were considered. The model accounts for the addition of PCs in each building belonging to students who browse the web normally (4 per building), as well as infected PCs (2 per building) that simulate DDoS attacks against the institutional portal.}
      
